    Recovery-steward: repair Executive dispatch E2BIG via private --prompt-file
    
    The assembled Executive prompt (~134 KB) exceeded Linux's 131072-byte
    per-argument ceiling, so every dispatch died at executive-cycle.sh:284 and
    the officer was reported unhealthy with prompts=0. Pass the identical prompt
    through Antonina's --prompt-file from an absolute 0600 temp file and remove it
    on exit. Add a hermetic regression that rejects inline --prompt and verifies
    the private file's bytes, mode, cleanup and bookkeeping; adapt existing mocks
    to read the prompt from the file.

